        "✅ Validates field not dropped (Tier 2)",
        "✅ Provides clear error messages for each validation",
        "✅ Returns structured ValidationResult with errors/warnings/successes",
        "✅ Confirms observe fields ARE valid references"
      ],
      "completion_summary": "Phase 3 COMPLETE: Created InputSignatureValidator with dataclass models (FieldValidationResult, ValidationResult). Validates field references against LLM context using Phase 1 parsing and Phase 2 computation. All 23 tests passing in 0.19s.",
      "actual_implementation": {
        "file": "agent_actions/agents/validators/input_signature_validator.py",
        "lines": 221,
        "classes": [
          "FieldValidationResult (dataclass)",
